reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768556449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768565515","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325#issuecomment-3768565515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/136325","id":3768565515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks7gn78L","user":{"login":"AutuSnow","id":144877719,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKKolw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144877719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow","html_url":"https://github.com/AutuSnow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T14:18:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:18:29Z","body":"/assign @thockin ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768565515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768908612","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325#issuecomment-3768908612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/136325","id":3768908612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks7gpPtE","user":{"login":"dhruvbehl","id":3843254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDMyNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3843254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl","html_url":"https://github.com/dhruvbehl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhruvbehl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T15:33:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T15:33:40Z","body":"@AutuSnow  Thanks for pointing out the issue! Quick question on a potential workaround:\r\n\r\nWe're running on EKS and the fix might take a while to reach us. In the meantime, can you confirm that escaping `$` to `$$` before non-ASCII characters would be a safe workaround?\r\n\r\nFor example, transforming `$£FOO` → `$$£FOO` in env var values before they hit K8s expansion.\r\n\r\nMy understanding is that `$$` bypasses variable expansion entirely, so the buggy `tryReadVariableName` code path would never be reached. The value would then correctly expand to $£FOO at runtime.\r\n\r\nIs this assumption correct?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768908612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768970183","html_url":"https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/136325#issuecomment-3768970183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/136325","id":3768970183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAToIks7gpevH","user":{"login":"AutuSnow","id":144877719,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKKolw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144877719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow","html_url":"https://github.com/AutuSnow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AutuSnow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-19T15:44:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T15:44:25Z","body":"@dhruvbehl In my opinion, your understanding is completely correct! Escaping $to $$is an effective temporary solution.\r\n$$is recognized as an escape sequence\r\n-In the tryReadVariableName function, when encountering $$, it will enter the case operator: branch\r\n-Return a single $character, isVar = false\r\n-Completely bypassed the problematic default: branch","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/comments/3768970183/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confuse